---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/ui/Container.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms — Kitchen Table Wonders"
  description="Terms for buying and using Kitchen Table Wonders printable country kits, including instant digital delivery and our no-refunds policy."
>
  <Container>
    <article class="legal">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 9 September 2026</p>

      <p>
        Welcome to Kitchen Table Wonders. By buying or downloading our products, or using
        kitchentablewonders.com, you agree to these terms. Please read them — the parts
        about digital products and copyright matter most.
      </p>

      <h2>1. What we sell</h2>
      <p>
        We sell digital, print-at-home products (printable PDFs). Nothing physical is
        shipped to you. After purchase you download the files and print them yourself at
        home. You will need a device to open a PDF and access to a printer.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Instant digital delivery &amp; no refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Because our products are digital and delivered instantly, all sales are final and
        non-refundable once the file has been delivered or downloaded. This is standard for
        digital downloads. If your file won't download, is missing, or appears damaged,
        contact us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@kitchentablewonders.com">hello@kitchentablewonders.com</a>
        and we will gladly fix it or re-send it — we want you to be happy with your
        purchase.
      </p>

      <h2>3. What you may do with our products (your license)</h2>
      <p>
        When you buy, we grant you a personal, non-transferable license for your own
        family's use. You may:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Print the files as many times as you like, for your own household.</li>
        <li>Use them in your own home with your own children.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. What you may NOT do</h2>
      <p>You may not:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Resell, share, forward, gift, sublicense, or distribute the files or printouts,
          whether free or for payment.
        </li>
        <li>Post the files anywhere others can download them.</li>
        <li>Claim the designs, text, or artwork as your own.</li>
        <li>
          Use the products or any part of them for commercial purposes (for example,
          selling printed copies, or using them in a paid class, camp, or business) without
          our written permission.
        </li>
        <li>
          Alter the files and redistribute them. Teachers, libraries, and group/commercial
          use: contact us for a separate license — we're happy to help.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Our intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        All content — designs, illustrations, text, layouts, the "Kitchen Table Wonders"
        name and branding — is owned by Kitchen Table Wonders and protected by copyright
        and trademark law. Buying a product gives you the license in Section 3 only; it
        does not transfer ownership of anything.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Accuracy and "as is"</h2>
      <p>
        We create our products with care, but they are provided "as is." Fun facts,
        recipes, and activities are for family entertainment and general interest. You are
        responsible for supervising your children, for any cooking, crafts, scissors, small
        parts, food allergies, or other safety matters during your activities. We are not
        liable for how the products are used.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent allowed by law, Kitchen Table Wonders is not liable for any
        indirect or consequential loss arising from the use of our products or website, and
        our total liability for any claim will not exceed the amount you paid for the
        product in question.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party sales platforms</h2>
      <p>
        Checkout and payment for our products is handled by Lemon Squeezy, our merchant of
        record. Your purchase is also subject to Lemon Squeezy's own terms of service and
        privacy policy, in addition to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms; the "Last updated" date shows the current version.
        Continued use after a change means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of Israel, without regard to conflict-of-law
        rules.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions? Email
        <a href="mailto:hello@kitchentablewonders.com">hello@kitchentablewonders.com</a>.
        We're a small family business and we read every message.
      </p>

      <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back home</a></p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .legal { max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 3rem 4rem; }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
  .updated { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal strong { color: var(--navy); }
  .back { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
